From: cizar-szymon <szymon@cs-lab.eu>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:50:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 20/27] A wider keys box; PAUSE in the middle of the screen

The keys box is a box of its own (KeysBox, 272x160, the frame of the
advanced box, two columns: key and meaning) instead of a popup, whose
frame pictures have a fixed size. While the game is paused, PAUSE in
large letters in the middle of the screen, hidden while a box is open.
